{# Synthetic court-file pages around an affidavit (layout L8): summons, complaint, judgment.
   Wording is generic and invented for testing; it is not a reproduction of any court form. #}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: Letter; margin: 0.9in 0.9in; }
  body { font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; }
  .court { text-align: center; } .court strong { display: block; }
  h1 { font-size: 13pt; text-align: center; letter-spacing: .08em; margin: 18px 0 10px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 10px; text-align: justify; }
  .page { break-before: page; }
  .page:first-child { break-before: auto; }
  .stamp { float: right; border: 2px solid #8a1c1c; color: #8a1c1c; padding: 6px 12px;
           text-align: center; font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-weight: bold;
           transform: rotate(-4deg); margin: 0 0 10px 14px; }
  .fineprint { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #444; margin-top: 24px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% if part == 'summons_complaint' %}
<div class="page">
  <div class="court"><strong>CIVIL COURT OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK</strong>COUNTY OF {{ county }}</div>
  <p>{{ aff.plaintiff }}, Plaintiff, against {{ aff.defendant_name }}, Defendant.
     Index No. {{ aff.index_number }}</p>
  <h1>SUMMONS</h1>
  <p>To the above named Defendant: YOU ARE HEREBY SUMMONED to appear in the Civil Court of the
  City of New York, County of {{ county }}, at the office of the Clerk, by answering the
  complaint of the plaintiff within the time allowed after service of this summons. Upon your
  failure to appear, judgment will be entered against you by default for the sum demanded in
  the complaint, with interest and costs.</p>
  <p>The nature of this action is a claim for money said to be owed on a consumer credit account.
  The amount the plaintiff demands is shown in the complaint served with this summons.</p>
  <p>Dated: {{ summons_date }}</p>
  <p class="fineprint">SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT &mdash; generated for ServeTrace testing.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="court"><strong>CIVIL COURT OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK</strong>COUNTY OF {{ county }}</div>
  <h1>VERIFIED COMPLAINT</h1>
  <p>Plaintiff, by its attorneys, as and for its complaint against the Defendant, alleges:</p>
  <p>1. Plaintiff is a purchaser of consumer credit accounts. 2. Upon information and belief,
  Defendant resides in the County of {{ county }}. 3. Defendant opened a credit account and
  made purchases or took cash advances on it. 4. Defendant failed to make the payments
  required, and a balance of ${{ balance }} remains unpaid. 5. The account was sold and
  assigned to Plaintiff, which is the present owner of it.</p>
  <p>6. No part of the balance has been paid although duly demanded.</p>
  <p class="fineprint">SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT &mdash; generated for ServeTrace testing.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>WHEREFORE, plaintiff demands judgment against the Defendant in the sum of ${{ balance }},
  together with interest, costs and disbursements of this action. (Complaint, continued.)</p>
  <h1>VERIFICATION</h1>
  <p>STATE OF NEW YORK, COUNTY OF {{ county }}, ss.: {{ agent_name }}, being duly sworn, deposes
  and says that deponent is an authorized agent of the plaintiff, has read the foregoing
  complaint, and knows the contents thereof to be true to deponent's own knowledge, except as
  to matters stated upon information and belief.</p>
  <p>______________________________<br>{{ agent_name }}</p>
  <p class="fineprint">SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT &mdash; generated for ServeTrace testing.</p>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="page">
  {% if judgment_style == 'stamp' %}
  <div class="stamp">ENTERED<br>{{ entry_printed }}<br>CLERK</div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="court"><strong>CIVIL COURT OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK</strong>COUNTY OF {{ county }}</div>
  <p>{{ aff.plaintiff }}, Plaintiff, against {{ aff.defendant_name }}, Defendant.
     Index No. {{ aff.index_number }}</p>
  <h1>JUDGMENT</h1>
  <p>The summons and complaint in this action having been served upon the Defendant on
  {{ aff.served_at.strftime('%B %-d, %Y') }}, and proof of service having been filed, and the
  time for the Defendant to answer having expired without an answer or appearance, the
  Defendant is in default.</p>
  <p>NOW, on motion of the plaintiff, it is ADJUDGED that {{ aff.plaintiff }} recover of
  {{ aff.defendant_name }} the sum of ${{ balance }} with interest of ${{ interest }} and costs of
  ${{ costs }}, amounting in all to ${{ total }}, and that the plaintiff have execution therefor.</p>
  {% if judgment_style == 'prose' %}
  <p>Judgment entered on {{ entry_printed }} by the Clerk of the Civil Court.</p>
  {% elif judgment_style == 'numeric' %}
  <p>Entered: {{ entry_printed }} &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ______________________ Clerk</p>
  {% else %}
  <p>______________________ Clerk of the Court</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="fineprint">SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT &mdash; generated for ServeTrace testing.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
</body>
</html>
